  "summary": "Malicious code in folder-lint (npm)",
  "details": "Folder-lint@1.0.17 contains a preinstall hook (setup.mjs) that downloads the Bun JavaScript runtime from github[.]com/oven-sh/bun/releases and then executes a 727KB heavily-obfuscated file (math_init.js) through it. The obfuscated payload makes up ~96% of the package and uses a custom base64 decoder with a large lookup table. The package's lib/ directory contains a decoy folder-linting library while the actual malicious behaviour runs at install time via the preinstall script.",
